                answer: "Birth time accuracy is crucial for precise chart calculations, especially for the Ascendant, Moon sign, and house placements. Even a few minutes can make a difference. If you don't know your exact birth time, we can help you rectify it using significant life events."
              },
              {
                question: "Do you offer astrology consultations?",
                answer: "While we don't provide direct consultations, our platform offers detailed interpretations that many professional astrologers use as a foundation for their readings. We also have a community of practitioners who offer consultations."
